'''Netherworld Nymph Lunacia''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

