|name2 = Death's Daughter Lunacia
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Death's Daughter Lunacia''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Death's Daughter Lunacia covers the bases that [[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]] doesn't, filling in the gaps for [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]], [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]].

She is much more heavily geared toward midranged tanking, using a more defensive combination of abilities in [[Strong Against]] and [[Weaken]], all while having very high base HP. Death's Daughter Lunacia has a far-reaching [[Omni Strike]] that ensures her attacks almost always connect, applying her Weaken up to 625 range with a ~60% uptime.

Lunacia has a good mix of bulk and damage, boasting 552,500 effective HP against Weakened Angels/Floating, alongside a very solid 10,260 DPS at Lv.30; against Traitless/Aku, she's a bit weaker, at 442,000 effective HP and 8,550 DPS, but these numbers are still quite good. She stands toe to toe with many dedicated tanks like [[Dogumaru (Special Cat)|Reborn Warrior Doguemon]] (394,400 EHP), including even the likes of other EPICFEST exclusives like [[Dark Aegis Garu (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Beastlord Garu]] (612,000 EHP) and [[Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|Lunos the Eclipsed]] (367,000 EHP) against Traitless at equal levels. This is without even mentioning just how good her matchups are in general: controlling and dispelling even the biggest hordes of pushers within her respective traits including [[Teacher Bun Bun]] variants, [[Boraphim]], [[Angelic Gory|Angelic]]/[[Aku Gory]] spam, etc., all without breaking so much as a sweat. Given her immunities, there's little hope of gimmicky enemies like [[Croakley]] or [[Henry]] encroaching upon her either.

Additionally, [[Surge Attack#Counter-Surge|Counter-Surge]] is an interesting ability. With Aku as one of her target traits, it functions similarly to [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Phantasmal Nobunaga]]'s Counter-Surge, carrying both Lunacia's Weaken and [[Shield Piercing|Shield Pierce]]. This allows her to abuse enemy Surge Attacks to not only maintain a nigh-100% uptime on her Weaken, but also massively increase her own personal damage depending on the situation. Outside of Aku Death Surges, the most notable use cases are against [[St. Dober]], [[Medu-san]], and [[Mini Angel Cyclone]], which can each be Weakened beforehand, letting Lunacia avoid the full brunt of the Surge damage while making her own. Against [[Kappy Jr.]] and [[Kappy Kawano]], Lunacia provides quick and reliable burst damage, hitting for huge numbers with her Counter-Surge while weakening target traits (though Kawano himself is immune). However, her low standing range means that she isn't very sustainable as a dedicated Counter-Surger, since the accumulated DPS tends to add up surprisingly quickly as certain enemies eat massive chunks off her HP while triggering the ability, though her fast cooldown and cheap cost can make up for that.

Overall, Death's Daughter Lunacia is a versatile unit. Her survivability is to the point where you can easily get two or three of them on the field at any given moment, and she's cheap too! Despite a lack of Wave Immunity and somewhat mediocre uptime, which can hinder her performance against certain Traitless, she makes up for those weaknesses in spades.

