==Trivia==
*Like [[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]], Netherworld Nymph Lunacia's Japanese name and description refer to her as a 天女 ''[https://yokai.com/tennyo/ tennyo]'' (lit. "heavenly woman"), a specifically female ''[[wikipedia:Tennin|tennin]]'' in Japanese Buddhism, originating from Hindu and Buddhist mythology as heavenly female water nymphs called [[wikipedia:Apsara|apsaras]]. ''Tennin'' are beautiful, angel-like beings who reside in the Buddhist realm of heaven Tendō (possibly the "foreign land" in Salvation's Daughter Lunacia's Japanese description) as companions of Buddhas and Bodhisattvas, and as such are associated with lotus flowers.

